        "Content": "Exceptional four bedroom period residence extending to three levels.\nBuilt c.1790 and listed on the National Inventory of Architectural Heritage.\nPrime location in the heart of the heritage town of Kells,\nRare opportunity to own a significant period home rich in history and character.\nElegant reception rooms with original period features throughout.\nPrivate cobblelock rear garden with terraced seating area.\nPrivate off-street parking for one car.\nWithin walking distance of schools, shops, cafés and restaurants.\nExcellent commuter access to the M3/M50 and easy access to frequent bus routes.\nA unique period home combining architectural significance with everyday convenience."
